The moves is "UD".
The sideways is 0.
The upward is 0.
The last is the last position of moves.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The step is the slice of moves from spot to spot plus 1.
If step matches "U", add 1 to upward.
If step matches "D", subtract 1 from upward.
If step matches "L", subtract 1 from sideways.
If step matches "R", add 1 to sideways.

If sideways is 0 and upward is 0, show true, otherwise show false.
